title: "tess-cloud-pipeline: Automated TESS Light-Curve Mining, Vetting, and Candidate Classification"
version: 2.7.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
url: "https://github.com/Arman-Bisht/tess-cloud-pipeline"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arman-Bisht/tess-cloud-pipeline"
license: MIT
abstract: "An automated astronomical data-mining pipeline that ingests, detrends, and analyzes high-cadence NASA TESS photometry to detect stellar variability, eclipsing binaries, and isolated transit-like events with automated physical vetting, Target Pixel File difference imaging, and multi-catalog cross-matching."
